5,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,We need to be precise about the budget this year to avoid any deficits. I suggest we look into the actual costs first.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Toshio,,I agree. We should also consider the workload involved in the arrangements so no one is unfairly burdened.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Minako,,I believe the social dynamics of the camp are just as important as the cost. We need a place that encourages interaction.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,I am concerned about the quality of rest for the members. A peaceful environment is essential for a productive camp.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Asuka,,We must ensure the financial distribution is equitable. I want to see how the costs were handled in previous years.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Asuka, that is a valid point. I will focus on the specific pricing and transport costs to get a clear picture.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Toshio,,I will look into the logistics of the bookings and the duties involved in managing the facilities.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Minako,,I will investigate the social aspects and the attendance patterns to see why some members might be hesitant.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,I will look into the actual living conditions and the feedback from previous inland trips.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Asuka,,I will examine the receipts and the terms for whole-building lets to identify any hidden costs or imbalances.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
